      "config": {
        "content": "Static locked-off camera, framing unchanged. The woman stands poised and confident, her outfit fully visible. She takes a slow, natural breath — the fabric of her clothing shifts and drapes elegantly with the movement. She gently smooths the outfit with one hand in a calm, graceful gesture, then lowers her arm back to her side. The clothing's texture, cut, and silhouette are showcased clearly throughout. Soft even studio lighting, neutral background."
