      "config": {
        "content": "Static locked-off camera, framing unchanged. The woman walks purposefully toward the camera at a brisk but still graceful pace — starting from a full-body wide shot, she strides forward with confidence and comes very close to the camera, ending in a tight mid-body close-up where her torso and outfit fill the frame. She stops right in front of the camera without stepping back. The movement is fluid and direct, the outfit clearly visible and flowing with every step."
