      "config": {
        "content": " A fictional young woman, holding a phone up near her face with her right hand as if filming a mirror selfie. She keeps the phone in the same right hand the entire time and never switches hands; the phone stays steadily near her face throughout. She shifts her weight from one leg to the other, slowly turning her hips side to side to show her outfit. With her free left hand she lightly touches her waist, then rests it on her hip. She lifts her free left hand toward her shoulder, tilts her head slightly, and turns her body gently from side to side. She lowers her left hand and returns to standing upright. Slow, graceful, natural movements. Soft even indoor lighting, vertical portrait framing, static camera, cinematic and realistic."
